OL,3,A'Targeted' attack on much-loved MP
OL,4,Aleaves Australian town heartbroken
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey are clearly in shock about what
OL,7,Fpolice say was a targeted and
OL,8,Fdeliberate attack on Helen Haines on
OL,9,FMonday afternoon, when she was struck
OL,10,Fby a car just outside her office.
OL,12,F"People are simply dumbfounded and
OL,13,Ffinding it very hard to fathom the
OL,14,Fscale of this tragedy," Australia's
OL,15,FGovernor-General Sam Mostyn, who
OL,16,Frepresents King Charles, said at a
OL,17,Fpress conference on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
